WEBVTT

00:00:00.698 --> 00:00:01.928
<b>I</b>’m your teacher.

00:00:04.986 --> 00:00:06.146
Listen to <b>me</b>!

00:00:09.224 --> 00:00:10.392
<b>You</b>’re beautiful.

00:00:13.407 --> 00:00:14.300
I love <b>you</b>.

00:00:17.372 --> 00:00:18.974
<b>He</b> goes to my gym.

00:00:21.997 --> 00:00:23.541
I see <b>him</b> every week.

00:00:26.591 --> 00:00:28.165
<b>She</b> never listens.

00:00:31.249 --> 00:00:32.661
Don’t talk to <b>her</b>.

00:00:35.751 --> 00:00:37.605
<b>It</b>’s a nice coat!

00:00:40.609 --> 00:00:42.289
I want <b>it</b> for Christmas.

00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:46.713
<b>We</b> aren’t friends.

00:00:49.795 --> 00:00:51.220
They don’t speak to <b>us</b>.

00:00:54.265 --> 00:00:55.765
<b>They</b>’re good books.

00:00:58.842 --> 00:01:00.230
I want to read <b>them</b>.